#   Allow WinRM from management: the source of the rule is in zone Domain, and a rule of Network Firewall names no zone: give the networks behind Domain with --zone-network; the destination of the rule is in zone Host, and a rule of Network Firewall names no zone: give the networks behind Host with --zone-network
