#   Echo request (ICMPv4-In): the source of the rule is in zone Private, Public, and a rule of Network Firewall names no zone: give the networks behind Private, Public with --zone-network; the destination of the rule is in zone Host, and a rule of Network Firewall names no zone: give the networks behind Host with --zone-network
#   Echo request (ICMPv6-In): references 'LocalSubnet6': dynamic address group, members are not known statically; the destination of the rule is in zone Host, and a rule of Network Firewall names no zone: give the networks behind Host with --zone-network
