#   Remote Desktop from the admin networks: the source of the rule is in zone Private, and a rule of Network Firewall names no zone: give the networks behind Private with --zone-network; the destination of the rule is in zone Host, and a rule of Network Firewall names no zone: give the networks behind Host with --zone-network
#   Web server: the source of the rule is in zone Private, Public, and a rule of Network Firewall names no zone: give the networks behind Private, Public with --zone-network; the destination of the rule is in zone Host, and a rule of Network Firewall names no zone: give the networks behind Host with --zone-network
#   FTP passive ports: the source of the rule is in zone Private, and a rule of Network Firewall names no zone: give the networks behind Private with --zone-network; the destination of the rule is in zone Host, and a rule of Network Firewall names no zone: give the networks behind Host with --zone-network
