#   Example application server: not converted: program C:\Program Files\Example\server.exe; the source of the rule is in zone Private, Public, and a rule of Network Firewall names no zone: give the networks behind Private, Public with --zone-network; the destination of the rule is in zone Host, and a rule of Network Firewall names
#   Print spooler (RPC): not converted: the local port keyword RPC; not converted: service Spooler; the source of the rule is in zone Private, Public, and a rule of Network Firewall names no zone: give the networks behind Private, Public with --zone-network; the destination of the rule is in zone Host, and a rule of Network
